{"id":"wb-3-29","name":"长汀革命旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"长汀革命旧址","text":"长汀革命旧址位于中国福建省龙岩市长汀县城区（旧为汀州市）内。长汀县是第一次国共内战期间中央革命根据地的重要组成部分。1988年中央红色医院旧址等六处旧址被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%95%BF%E6%B1%80%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92174311,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92174311","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/62f68dea1ca56ba3a9e9c8da.jpg","title":"Changting_Yunxiang_Ge_2013.10.06_09-24-30.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Changting_Yunxiang_Ge_2013.10.06_09-24-30.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/df/Changting_Yunxiang_Ge_2013.10.06_09-24-30.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"福建省长汀县云骧阁（长汀县革命委员会旧址）——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}